OL,3,GNEWSA'We've made mistakes': Regional
OL,4,Abalance 'front and centre' for Invest
OL,5,ANI
OL,6,
OL,7,FA senior figure at Invest Northern
OL,8,FIreland in the north west has said she
OL,9,Fwants to restore trust in the
OL,10,Forganisation as part of her new role
OL,11,Fbut would not have taken the job if she
OL,12,Fdid not believe it was truly committed
OL,13,Fto regional balance.
OL,15,FAeidin McCarter, who was announced as
OL,16,FInvest NI's head of regional business
OL,17,Ffor the north west in May, said
OL,18,F"mistakes have been made" in the past
OL,19,Fbut regional balance is now "front and
OL,20,Fcentre" for the organisation.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
