OL,3,GNEWSA'We've made mistakes': Regional
OL,4,Abalance 'front and centre' for Invest
OL,5,ANI
OL,6,
OL,7,FInvest NI has faced criticism over the
OL,8,Flevel of inward investment in the north
OL,9,Fwest.
OL,11,FIn 2025, Strabane business leader
OL,12,FKieran Kennedy resigned from the board
OL,13,Fof Invest NI after alleging
OL,14,Fdiscrimination against the north west.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
